OL,3,GNEWSARain warning for Cornwall and     
OL,4,AIsles of Scilly                        
OL,6,FA yellow weather warning for rain is   
OL,7,Fcurrently in place across Cornwall and 
OL,8,Fthe Isles of Scilly.                   
OL,10,FThe Met Office said the warning would  
OL,11,Fbe in place from 08:01 GMT on Tuesday  
OL,12,Funtil 23:59 and warned heavy rain could
OL,13,Fcause some flooding and travel         
OL,14,Fdisruption.                            
OL,16,FIt said a band of heavy rain would     
OL,17,Fslowly move across the county          
OL,18,Fthroughout the day before easing       
OL,19,Fovernight, with about 30mm to 40mm     
OL,20,F(1.2in to 1.6in) of rain expected to   
OL,21,Ffall.                                  
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
