OL,3,GNEWSARain warning for Cornwall and     
OL,4,AIsles of Scilly                        
OL,6,FThe persistent rain has caused some    
OL,7,Froads to flood and Cornwall Council has
OL,8,Furged people not to walk or drive      
OL,9,Fthrough floodwater.                    
